	'courses_h1' => 'Project management',
	'courses_b1' => 'The project-management pathway holds three courses. Project Delivery Foundations is course 01: 24 lessons, 18 hours, priced at $149. It follows a delivery from the first framing of the work through planning, a visible status, and a clean close, and it ends with one mock exam. Agile Practitioner Track is course 02: 20 lessons, 15 hours, priced at $169. The lessons stay with agile practice a working team can run: a board people can see, a short cycle, and a regular conversation about what to do next. Advanced Project Leadership is course 03: 32 lessons, 26 hours, priced at $229. It is the longest course in the catalogue and is meant for people who already coordinate others. Tomasz Wierzbicki teaches courses 01 and 03. Amara Osei teaches course 02. Buy any one of them on its own, or take all three as the pathway bundle.',
	'courses_h2' => 'IT',
