	'courses_h3' => 'Which plan to use',
	'courses_b3' => 'Choose from the work you are already doing. If you need one subject, buy that course for 12 months of access. A single course starts at $149, which is the price of Project Delivery Foundations. The other five courses have their own prices. If you want a whole pathway, the bundle is $429 for the three courses of one track, either project management or IT, with 18 months of access. You do not mix the two tracks inside one bundle. If you want both pathways, all-access is $690 for all six courses, with 24 months of access. Every plan includes a study planner, a certificate of completion, and a refund within 14 days if you have watched less than 20 percent. Instructor feedback on two assignments is included on the pathway bundle and on all-access. It is not included on a single course. Live Q&A runs on Wednesdays at 19:00 CET: monthly on a single course, weekly on the bundle and on all-access.',
	'project_delivery_foundations_title' => 'Project Delivery Foundations',
	'project_delivery_foundations_intro' => 'Project Delivery Foundations is course 01 on the project-management pathway, taught by Tomasz Wierzbicki. It is 24 lessons and 18 hours, priced at $149.',
	'project_delivery_foundations_h1' => 'The lessons',
	'project_delivery_foundations_b1' => 'Project Delivery Foundations is for people who need a clear sequence for taking a piece of work from a brief to a close. The curriculum is one list of 24 lessons in the lesson player, recorded for 18 hours in all. You open them during your access period and move at your own pace. There is no classroom day to attend, and there is no separate workshop. The recorded lessons are made at the academy studio in Rotterdam. Framing the work, planning it, keeping status visible, and finishing cleanly are the substance of the course. One mock exam sits after the lessons. It is practice for this course, not an external certification test. When you have taken it, you can download a certificate of completion from Shikaku Academy. The course prepares you for widely recognised project-management credentials. It does not award those credentials, and the academy does not publish a pass rate.',
	'project_delivery_foundations_h2' => 'Price and what is included',
