	'plans_h5' => 'What does all-access cost?',
	'plans_b5' => 'All-access costs $690. It includes all six courses for 24 months: the three project-management courses and the three IT courses. Mock exams cover all six. Live Q&A is weekly, on Wednesdays at 19:00 CET. A study planner, a certificate of completion, and instructor feedback on two assignments are included. You pay once, by card, in USD. VAT is shown at checkout. This is the plan to use when you want both pathways. If you only want one pathway, the bundle at $429 is the smaller plan. If you only want one course, buy that course at its list price, from $149. The refund rule does not change with the higher price: within 14 days, if you have watched less than 20 percent. After payment, the six courses appear in My courses and open in the lesson player at your pace.',
	'plans_h6' => 'When does the 14-day refund apply?',
	'plans_b6' => 'A refund is available on every plan: single course, pathway bundle, and all-access. Two conditions sit together. The request falls within 14 days, and you have watched less than 20 percent. The rule is the same at $149 and at $690. It is a way out of a purchase that was wrong for you, not a promise about what the course will do at work. Write to support@shikaku-academy.example, or use the form on the Support page, and name the course or plan. Learner support is open Monday to Friday from 08:00 to 18:00 CET and Saturday from 09:00 to 13:00 CET. Priya Raman leads that desk. The academy does not publish a different refund window for live Q&A, for the mock exam, or for the certificate of completion. If you have watched 20 percent or more, or the 14 days have passed, this refund rule is the one the price list states, and it would not apply.',
	'how_it_works_title' => 'How it works',
